{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_24","type":"agent_message","text":"The measured version narrowly loses on fitness: its 7.9% Fmax gain is just below its 8.0% CoreMark cycle increase. I found a way to keep the registered EX boundary while presenting the registered target to fetch during the pending cycle. That replaces the sequential fetch before it can advance and should avoid the extra bubble; I’ll verify this version against the same gates."}}
