n its own PID namespace where $$ is 2 or 3\n# for every agent, so siblings wrote into one dir and wiped each other's\n# checks mid-SBY (V2 incident 03). mktemp gives a unique name instead.\n# FORMAL_WORK_ID pins the suffix so tools/eval/formal.py can remove exactly\n# its own dir afterwards. genchecks.py derives @core\n…[7160 of 10232 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:719573a0f50e8fc7]…\nhannel-1 checks. NRET=2 contract: when a\n        # single-issue hypothesis ties io_rvfi_valid_1 to 0, the per-channel\n        # BMC's assumption (rvfi_valid_1=1) is unsatisfiable, and SBY\n        # reports Status: PREUNSAT (rc=16). The property holds vacuously\n        # over the empty set of ch1-valid traces — a legitimate pass.\n        # Dual-issue hypotheses make the assumption satisfiable, so this\n        # branch never matches and the regular DONE (PASS branch covers it.\nname: bench\ndescription: Frozen LLM-benchmark fixture core. Identical RTL to baseline at the bench-fixture-v1\n  freeze point. The benchmark matrix clones from the bench-fixture-v1 orphan branch\n  and operates only on this directory.\nisa: rv32im\nnret: 1\ntarget_fpga: tang-nano-20k\ntargets:\n  fmax_mhz: 135\n  lut4: 10000\n  coremark_iter_s: 300\n  coremark_per_mhz: 2.2\ncurrent:\n  fmax_mhz: 47.649\n  lut4: 2558\n  ff: 630\n  coremark_iter_s: 2.0e-06\n  coremark_per_mhz: 0.0\n  source_id: hyp-20260930-002-r1s1\n  updated: '2026-09-30T05:19:25.248281Z'\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
