 likely the deepest logic\\non this operand path and dominate the measured Fmax.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Replace the combinational DIV/DIVU/REM/REMU operators with a shared bounded\\niterative divider that captures operands and returns a quotient or remainder\\nafter 32 steps. Interlock the EX pipeline for those instructions only, keeping\\ntheir forwarding, retirement, divide-by-zero, and signed-overflow behavior\\nprecise. This removes the divider chain from the single-cycle EX timing path;\\nCoreMark should gain Fmax, with cycle cost only if its workloa\n…[49634 of 52706 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:89ba4d5e554d4b33]…\n, \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 89.81, \"delta_pct\": -15.34, \"vs_baseline\": 641.01, \"fmax_mhz\": 40.341, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4491817, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 8666, \"ff\": 649, \"seeds\": [40.067, 40.341, 40.341], \"perturbations\": [[0, 40.067, 26], [1, 40.341, 26], [2, 40.341, 26]], \"lutram\": 527, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_mem/reg_q.rd_0_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_id/reg_q.rs1_val_15_s0\", \"slack_ns\": -19.958, \"arrival_ns\": 30.252, \"logic_cells\": 56, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_fwd\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_if\", \"cpu/u_rf\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 26, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-30T07:34:24.053997Z\", \"slot\": 0, \"round_id\": 5, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-09-30 hyp-20260930-001-r5s0 (regression, -15.34%): Per-bit one-hot masked-OR reads expanded each 31-row flop-based register-file port into a high-fanout decode and reduction network, whose area and routing cost outweighed removing the indexed-read bypass mux.\"}\n", "exit_code": 2, "status": "failed"}}
