ient or remainder\\nafter 32 steps. Interlock the EX pipeline for those instructions only, keeping\\ntheir forwarding, retirement, divide-by-zero, and signed-overflow behavior\\nprecise. This removes the divider chain from the single-cycle EX timing path;\\nCoreMark should gain Fmax, with cycle cost only if its workload executes divides.\\nPreserve the RISCV_FORMAL_ALTOPS stand-ins for formal runs.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 15, \"confidence\": \"m\n…[112875 of 115947 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:e3baf1ce9f585dc3]…\n38, \"vs_baseline\": 1085.89, \"fmax_mhz\": 61.9, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4306745, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 3074, \"ff\": 629, \"seeds\": [63.482, 61.9, 61.9], \"perturbations\": [[0, 63.482, 10], [1, 61.9, 10], [2, 61.9, 10]], \"lutram\": 40, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/squash_token_q_s0\", \"to\": \"dmem_1_dmem_1_0_0_s\", \"slack_ns\": -10.752, \"arrival_ns\": 21.047, \"logic_cells\": 12, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\", \"cpu/u_id\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 10, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-30T10:46:28.060565Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 11, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-09-30 hyp-20260930-003-r11s2 (regression, -4.38%): Compressing a BTB entry to a 12-bit target does not remove prediction cost when `if_stage` still compares the full PC tag, decodes the fetched branch, checks its immediate, and selects the predicted PC; fetch-side logic can outweigh saved EX redirects for a single hot backedge.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
