\n    description: \"Expose the combinational load result for forwarding into decode when the data-memory transaction completes.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Consume already-forwarded ID/EX operands directly while retaining EX/MEM result and RVFI operand reporting.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
