g selection from the execute arithmetic path and raise Fmax; the added branch-resolution distance is the main IPC risk.\\n\",\n    \"expected_impact\": {\n      \"fitness_delta_pct\": 8,\n      \"confidence\": \"medium\"\n    },\n    \"changes\": [\n      {\n        \"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\",\n        \"description\": \"Add the operand-stage boundary and connect the refactored execute pipeline while preserving the top-level I/O and retirement contract.\"\n \n…[8368 of 11440 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:13fde9b8c7be7cd0]…\nile leaving operand and ALU datapaths independent of the token.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"outcome\": \"regression\",\n  \"fitness\": 114.08,\n  \"delta_pct\": 2.49,\n  \"vs_baseline\": 841.25,\n  \"fmax_mhz\": 51.17,\n  \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06,\n  \"cycles\": 4485293,\n  \"iterations\": 10,\n  \"lut4\": 2542,\n  \"ff\": 633,\n  \"seeds\": [\n    49.909,\n    51.17,\n    51.17\n  ],\n  \"perturbations\": [\n    [\n      0,\n      49.909,\n      13\n    ],\n    [\n      1,\n      51.17,\n      12\n    ],\n    [\n      2,\n      51.17,\n      12\n    ]\n  ],\n  \"lutram\": 8,\n  \"bsram\": 6,\n  \"dsp\": 6,\n  \"critical_path\": {\n    \"from\": \"cpu/u_rf/regs_regs_0_0_s\",\n    \"to\": \"dmem_1_dmem_1_0_0_s\",\n    \"slack_ns\": -15.036,\n    \"arrival_ns\": 25.331,\n    \"logic_cells\": 15,\n    \"modules\": [\n      \"clock_ibuf\",\n      \"cpu/u_id\",\n      \"cpu/u_ex\",\n      \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\",\n      \"cpu/u_ex\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"logic_levels\": 13,\n  \"formal_passed\": true,\n  \"cosim_passed\": true,\n  \"error\": null,\n  \"implementation_notes\": \"\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-30T09:48:12.607442Z\",\n  \"slot\": 1,\n  \"round_id\": 9\n}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
