encies from registered EX/MEM, completed MEM load, and MEM/WB sources without a current EX-result input.\"\n  - file: rtl/id_stage.sv\n    description: \"Capture only values supplied by the register file or registered-stage forwarding sources.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
