cute to consume registered forwarded operands and retain precise branch, memory, and divider behavior.\"\n  - file: rtl/forward_unit.sv\n    description: \"Update forwarding priorities and sources for the additional in-flight stage.\"\n  - file: rtl/hazard_unit.sv\n    description: \"Adjust load-use, redirect, divider, and bus-stall controls for the split execute pipeline.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
