file\": \"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Propagate the execute-unit busy condition as a pipeline stall without duplicating retirement or memory side effects.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Wire divider busy/valid control into pipeline hazard handling while retaining the existing top-level I/O contract.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta\n…[19055 of 22127 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:05d3dc2357cc315e]…\nSeparate fetch response stalls from decode consumption so queued instructions can advance while the imem bus is stalled.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Wire fetch FIFO valid/consume and downstream hold controls while preserving the existing top-level and RVFI contract.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 107.21, \"delta_pct\": 1.07, \"vs_baseline\": 784.57, \"fmax_mhz\": 50.359, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4697199, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 2634, \"ff\": 637, \"seeds\": [48.548, 50.359, 50.359], \"perturbations\": [[0, 48.548, 13], [1, 50.359, 12], [2, 50.359, 12]], \"lutram\": 24, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_rf/regs_regs_0_0_s0\", \"to\": \"dmem_0_dmem_0_0_0_s\", \"slack_ns\": -15.598, \"arrival_ns\": 25.893, \"logic_cells\": 15, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_id\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 13, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-30T07:43:22.435948Z\", \"slot\": 1, \"round_id\": 5}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
