{"type": "item.completed", "item": {"id": "item_20", "type": "command_execution", "command": "/bin/bash -c \"rg -n 'dmem_3|16384|IF0008' cores/bench/generated cores/bench 2>/dev/null | head -100\"", "aggregated_output": "cores/bench/generated/timing/gowin_p0/gw.log:65:ERROR (IF0008) : The number(16384) of DFF used to infer \"dmem_3\" exceeds the resource limit(15750) of current device(GW2AR-LV18QN88C8/I7)\ncores/bench/generated/timing/gowin_p0/impl/gwsynthesis/core_bench.log:43:ERROR (IF0008) : The number(16384) of DFF used to infer \"dmem_3\" exceeds the resource limit(15750) of current device(GW2AR-LV18QN88C8/I7)\ncores/bench/LESSONS.md:12:- 2026-09-30 hyp-20260930-002-r6s1 (placement_failed, n/a): Gowin stopped before timing because `dmem_3` exceeded the GW2AR limit at 16,384 DFFs versus 15,750, while the store queue’s unpacked address/data/mask arrays were inferred as RAMs; inspect small-FIFO memory mapping and device headroom before evaluating performance.\ncores/bench/experiments/log.jsonl:18:{\"id\": \"hyp-20260930-002-r6s1\", \"title\": \"Buffer stores across data bus stalls\", \"category\": \"structural\", \"motivation\": \"Random data-bus backpressure currently freezes every pipeline stage whenever\\na store waits in MEM. This serializes unrelated arithmetic and control\\ninstructions behind a write whose address and data are already known.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": {\"motivation\": \"Random data-bus backpressure currently freezes every pipeline stage whenever\\na store waits in MEM. This serializes unrelated arithmetic and control\\ninstructions behind a write whose address and data are already known.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Add a small in-order store buffer between MEM and the external data bus.\\nEnqueue ordinary RAM stores when they reach MEM and let younger instructions\\nproceed while the buffer drains, stalling only when it is full. Keep loads\\nordered by waiting for older buffered stores to drain before issuing them,\\nand keep MMIO writes synchronous so the CoreMark timing markers and UART\\nretain their ordering. Holding each queued request stable until io_dmemReady\\nshould hide isolated write stalls and improve CoreMark IPC; the main risk is\\nqueue and hazard-control logic offsetting that gain in area or timing.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 7, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/mem_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Queue ordinary RAM stores, drain the oldest request until accepted, and expose queue-full and empty status while preserving load extraction and RVFI metadata.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Replace blanket store backpressure stalls with store-buffer capacity control; serialize loads and synchronous MMIO stores behind pending writes.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Connect the store-buffer controls and route the oldest pending request to the external dmem interface without changing the core I/O contract.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 7, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/mem_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Queue ordinary RAM stores, drain the oldest request until accepted, and expose queue-full and empty status while preserving load extraction and RVFI metadata.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Replace blanket store backpressure stalls with store-buffer capacity control; serialize loads and synchronous MMIO stores behind pending writes.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Connect the store-buffer controls and route the oldest pending request to the external dmem interface without changing the core I/O contract.\"}], \"outcome\": \"placement_failed\", \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": \"placement_failed\", \"seeds\": [null, null, null], \"slot\": 1, \"round_id\": 6, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-09-30 hyp-20260930-002-r6s1 (placement_failed, n/a): Gowin stopped before timing because `dmem_3` exceeded the GW2AR limit at 16,384 DFFs versus 15,750, while the store queue\\u2019s unpacked address/data/mask arrays were inferred as RAMs; inspect small-FIFO memory mapping and device headroom before evaluating performance.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
